<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 78.50 to 7079.39, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.87 to 427.70, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.40.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1639 to 856.</p>
<p>Volume was 458,747,570 compared 505,791,620 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
